1. High-Level Architecture Diagram
The system follows a Hybrid Architecture: Sensitive PII (Personal Identifiable Information) is kept off-chain in encrypted storage, while identity hashes, consent, and verification attestations are recorded immutably on the Canton Ledger (Blockchain).

